, "type": "question"}]}], "template_override": 1, "id": 11, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " \nImagine you are a tour guide. Which building in your city would you show?\n"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}]}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le15ob07re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le15ob07re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn6le15ob07re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn6le15ob07re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "How romantic would it be to have a building dedicated to you? How beautiful should it be? These are a few questions people have asked themselves ever since the Taj Mahal was built. <br><br>\nShah Jahan, who was an emperor in India, loved his wife Mumtaz Mahal so much that after her death he decided to build a monument in her memory. It would be as beautiful as she was."}, {"time": "23100", "image": "engenn6le15ob07re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "It took 22 years to complete this stunning piece of architecture. <br>\nThe Taj Mahal has a main gateway, a large garden, a mosque, a guest house, and several other buildings. The garden is divided into four sections by four shallow pools, and each of the four sections is also divided into perfect geometrical order."}, {"time": "46000", "image": "engenn6le15ob07re2img03.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "The interior and exterior designs include flowers and calligraphy made of gemstones.The mausoleum houses the two graves of the loving couple. It has remained a landmark of love and devotion for many generations."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}]}